        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Powers ESP32-C6 DevKit (5V0 pin)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "With EN left open, the buck regulator may remain disabled; the +5V rail and the ESP32 supply would then be unavailable, preventing normal board operation.",
      "confidence": 0.98
